sequenceDiagram
  actor Admin
  participant Web
  participant API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Admin->>Web: Save approved clinic facts
  Web->>API: PUT /api/v1/staff/clinic-settings + JWT + expected_version
  API->>API: Verify JWT, active staff and admin guard
  API->>DB: BEGIN; advisory lock; recheck active admin FOR UPDATE
  API->>DB: Lock singleton and compare revision
  alt Invalid role or stale revision
    API->>DB: ROLLBACK
    API-->>Web: 403 or 409
  else Authorized current revision
    API->>DB: Parameterized upsert + audit
    API->>DB: COMMIT (rollback on failure)
    API-->>Web: Updated settings
  end
  actor Patient
  participant Mobile
  Patient->>Mobile: Open own schedule
  Mobile->>API: GET /api/v1/account/care + JWT
  API->>DB: Derive patients.profile_id from authenticated identity
  alt Linked patient exists
    API->>DB: Read appointments for derived patient only
    API-->>Mobile: Own limited care summary
  else No linked patient
    API-->>Mobile: No linked care access
  end
